#### Unlocks and emissions ahead

- The TGE vesting is finished. All vCOW finished vesting on 2026-02-12 (Core Team, forum 3454). However, 121,667,793 vCOW (12.2% of supply) is still unswapped (on-chain, 2026-11-10 ~15:50 UTC; 121,670,066 at 14:50 UTC) and can be converted 1:1 to COW at any time. The vCOW contract holds 121,672,801 COW to back this. The largest vCOW holders (Blockscout) are an unlabeled Safe 0xca07EaA4…709A with 57.3M vCOW, the GnosisDAO Safe 0x0DA0C3e5…5aFe with 12.9M, and a Safe 0x246bb72f…c70C with 11.3M. This is a latent supply overhang, not a scheduled unlock.

- Team grant (CIP-83, passed 2026-02-02): 50M COW replenishment streamed over 4 years, plus a performance-linked tier of up to 100M COW tied to milestones (Blockworks filing). KPK reports that 25M COW was moved under CIP-83 in H1 2026.

- Solver rewards: paid in COW weekly. On-chain, COW sent out of the Solver Payouts Safe totals 5.09M (30d), 13.08M (90d) and 54.22M (365d). The Core Team projected 60–72M COW of solver emissions for 2026 ([Jan 2026 recap](https://cow.fi/learn/cow-dao-monthly-recap-january-2026)). These emissions are offset by buybacks (see section 7).

- Grants: CIP-82 (CoW Grants 2026 renewal, passed 2026-01-15).

- Balancer arrangement: 631,850.82 COW previously held by Balancer DAO under CIP-69 was released from its January 2027 lock by CIP-89 (passed 2026-10-07). The repurchase is executed under the buyback mandate.

