#### Copy-paste commands

Total supply and a balance (public RPC; 0x70a08231 = balanceOf):

curl -s https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com -H 'content-type: application/json' \ -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0xDEf1CA1fb7FBcDC777520aa7f396b4E015F497aB","data":"0x18160ddd"},"latest"]}'# COW balance of the Buyback Recipient Safecurl -s https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com -H 'content-type: application/json' \ -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"eth_call","params":[{"to":"0xDEf1CA1fb7FBcDC777520aa7f396b4E015F497aB","data":"0x70a08231000000000000000000000000a2bfc70e63a48bdfc3f8013a44b04b6c33fb8200"},"latest"]}'

Buyback fills: COW flowing from GPv2Settlement into the Buyback Recipient. Filter from == 0x9008…ab41 and sum value/1e18.

curl -s "https://api.etherscan.io/v2/api?chainid=1&module=account&action=tokentx&address=0xA2BFc70e63a48BDfc3F8013a44B04b6c33fb8200&contractaddress=0xDEf1CA1fb7FBcDC777520aa7f396b4E015F497aB&page=1&offset=1000&sort=desc&apikey=$ETHERSCAN_API_KEY"

Buyback TWAP trades straight from the CoW API (no key needed). Each entry shows sellToken WETH, buyToken COW, the amounts and txHash:

curl -s "https://api.cow.fi/mainnet/api/v1/trades?owner=0x22af3D38E50ddedeb7C47f36faB321eC3Bb72A76"

Solver rewards paid in COW: outflows from the Payouts Safe.

curl -s "https://api.etherscan.io/v2/api?chainid=1&module=account&action=tokentx&address=0xA03be496e67Ec29bC62F01a428683D7F9c204930&contractaddress=0xDEf1CA1fb7FBcDC777520aa7f396b4E015F497aB&page=1&offset=1000&sort=desc&apikey=$ETHERSCAN_API_KEY"

Fees and revenue (DefiLlama; the slug is cowswap, not cow-protocol):

curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/fees/cowswap?dataType=dailyFees"curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/fees/cowswap?dataType=dailyRevenue"curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/fees/cowswap?dataType=dailyHoldersRevenue"   # returns 0curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/aggregators/cowswap?dataType=dailyVolume"

Top holders, and the vCOW overhang:

curl -s "https://eth.blockscout.com/api/v2/tokens/0xDEf1CA1fb7FBcDC777520aa7f396b4E015F497aB/holders"curl -s "https://eth.blockscout.com/api/v2/tokens/0xD057B63f5E69CF1B929b356b579Cba08D7688048/holders"

Governance state:

curl -s https://hub.snapshot.org/graphql -H 'content-type: application/json' \ -d '{"query":"{proposals(first:10,where:{space:\"cow.eth\"},orderBy:\"created\",orderDirection:desc){title state end scores_total}}"}'

#### Official dashboards

- Buyback query: [dune.com/queries/5273980](https://dune.com/queries/5273980/8661207)

- Protocol dashboards: [dune.com/cowprotocol](https://dune.com/cowprotocol)

- Treasury: [app.syncrone.fi/public/cow](https://app.syncrone.fi/public/cow)

- Solvers: [explorer.cow.fi/solvers](https://explorer.cow.fi/solvers)

#### Caveats

- Protocol fees are netted in weekly solver accounting. There is therefore no single "fee transfer" per trade, and summing WETH into the Payouts Safe understates revenue. DefiLlama's adapter uses CoW's Dune tables.

- Revenue on L2s and other chains is settled separately. CIP-68 moved COW reward distribution for all chains to mainnet.

