- 2026-10-28: CIP-90 Fee Policy Iteration passed (39.3M For, 0 Against). It gives a standing fee mandate: volume fee between −0.5% and +0.5%, and at least 50% of price-improvement fees to the DAO.

- 2026-10-28: CIP-91 ($10.45M 2027 service agreement with Nomev Labs) and CIP-92 (CoW Foundation budget raised from $180k to $500k per year; COW buyback responsibility moved from CoW Business to the Foundation; Token Terminal reporting) posted. Both are on Snapshot until 2026-11-11, with 28.48M and 39.19M For respectively at 2026-11-10 ~15:30 UTC. CIP-91 is below the 35M COW quorum at that reading; CIP-92 is above it.

