| Not scheduled | CIP for the value-distribution framework: burn trial, buyback up to 100% of revenue, revised circulating supply | A formal vote passes with a single buy-and-burn address | Further delay, or the trial window (through December 2026) lapses |

| Early December 2026 | November monthly recap and KPK treasury report | Volume and share recover above $4B and 15% | Volume stays at or below $3B and share falls further |

