| Ongoing | Fee changes under CIP-90 (volume fee −0.5% to +0.5%) | Higher revenue per dollar without losing volume | Fee cuts to chase volume reduce revenue |

| Through October 2028 | MEV Blocker sale installments | Steady non-operating inflows to the treasury | None |

| Any time | vCOW conversions or sales (121.7M), team-grant flows | None | Large transfers to exchanges |

