As of 2026-11-10. Live reads taken 2026-11-10 between ~14:00 and 16:05 UTC unless stated otherwise (independent fact-check re-reads at 15:50–16:05 UTC). Price reference: CoinGecko $71.66 (last_updated 2026-11-10 15:53 UTC); Hyperliquid HYPE/USDC mark $71.62 at the same time (it was $73.08 at 14:53 UTC).

### Executive summary

HYPE is the native token of Hyperliquid, a layer-1 blockchain whose main product is an on-chain order-book exchange for perpetual futures and spot (HyperCore), with an EVM smart-contract layer (HyperEVM) running on the same chain. Value does reach holders today, and in large size. Almost all trading-fee revenue is sent automatically to the Assistance Fund (AF) system address 0xfefe…fefe, which buys HYPE on the open market. Validators voted in December 2025 to treat that HYPE as burned. The flow was about $68.2M over the last 30 days, per DefiLlama "holders revenue". Since October 2026 a second source has been added: about $15M per month of Coinbase/Circle USDC reserve yield (AQAv2). The AF on-chain balance of 48.81M HYPE, bought at an average entry of $29.32 (total entry notional $1.43B, 2026-11-10), matches DefiLlama's all-time holders revenue of $1.405B.

The current state is "healthy business, cooling token". HYPE set an all-time high of $97.96 on 2026-09-23 and is about 27% below it ($71.66 at 2026-11-10 15:53 UTC). Revenue is well below its late-2025 peak: $88.0M of fees in October 2026 against $124.8M in October 2025. The main hope is US/TradFi expansion through HIP-3 builder markets: ICE with trade[XYZ], Payward/Kraken through Bitnomial, and the US HYPE ETFs. The main things to watch are monthly fee and revenue run-rate against token issuance. Staking emissions (about 9.8M HYPE/yr, an estimate) plus core-contributor distributions from a 238.1M HYPE vesting address are roughly equal to or larger than the HYPE the AF buys, so HYPE is not yet net-deflationary.

### What the token is

- Ticker / name: HYPE (Hyperliquid). The native token of the Hyperliquid L1. It went live at the genesis event on 2024-11-29 (Hyperliquid tokenDetails.deployTime = 2024-11-29T06:45:52 UTC).

- Where it lives:

- HyperCore spot token index 150, tokenId 0x0d01dc56dcaaca66ad901c959b4011ec; 8 wei decimals.

- On HyperEVM (chain id 999), HYPE is the native gas token. Native HYPE enters and leaves HyperEVM through system address 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222, which held 945,693,177 HYPE of EVM-side reserve on 2026-11-10 15:55 UTC (eth_getBalance). The wrapped ERC-20 is WHYPE (verified contract name WHYPE9 on Etherscan V2) at 0x5555555555555555555555555555555555555555, with totalSupply 3,221,291 WHYPE on 2026-11-10 15:55 UTC (RPC totalSupply() and Etherscan V2 chainid=999 agree; it was 3,213,586 at ~14:30 UTC).

- There is no canonical ERC-20 on Ethereum. Upbit lists deposits and withdrawals on HyperEVM only [23].

- Original allocation (1,000,000,000 max): genesis distribution (airdrop) 31.0%, future emissions and community rewards 38.888%, core contributors 23.8%, Hyper Foundation budget 6.0%, community grants 0.3%, HIP-2 0.012% (Hyper Foundation genesis announcement, November 2024; the split is not in the docs text [1] and was not re-opened in the fact-check). There was no VC or exchange allocation. The Hyperliquid docs state development is "fully self-funded, with no VCs or external capital" [1]. The genesis user-balance list returned by tokenDetails has 94,023 entries summing to exactly 1,000,000,000.

| Supply metric (HYPE) | Value | As of | Source / method |

| --- | --- | --- | --- |

| Max supply | 1,000,000,000 | 2026-11-10 | Hyperliquid info API tokenDetails [6] |

| Total supply (protocol view) | 998,763,900.2 | 2026-11-10 15:53 UTC | Same. 1,236,100 HYPE has already been removed by protocol burns: priority fees, deploy auctions, HyperEVM base and priority fees, dust [1]. |

| Future emissions (unissued reserve) | 410,034,533.3 | 2026-11-10 15:53 UTC | tokenDetails.futureEmissions. Staking rewards are paid from this reserve [4]. |

| Core-contributor vesting address 0x43e9abea1910387c4292bca4b94de81462f8a251 | 238,147,366.4 (100% delegated/staked) | 2026-11-10 | tokenDetails.nonCirculatingUserBalances; delegatorSummary |

| Assistance Fund 0xfefe…fefe (treated as burned) | 48,806,030.8 | 2026-11-10 15:53 UTC | spotClearinghouseState; entryNtl $1,430,880,978 |

