#### Emissions and unlocks

- No vesting cliffs and no token unlock calendar. All 16M tokens exist. The LEND→AAVE migrator was wound down: on 2026-05-09 it returned its remaining 302,384 AAVE to the Ecosystem Reserve ([tx 0x34c49e47…](https://etherscan.io/tx/0x34c49e472e89d06dcb1182199a525d74580ff1699859d6d9c227614ad291ad68)).

- Ongoing "emission" means transfers out of the Ecosystem Reserve, not new minting. There are three:

- stkAAVE rewards are 150 AAVE/day, about 54,750 AAVE/yr (0.34% of supply). The author read assets(stkAAVE).emissionPerSecond = 0.0017361 AAVE/s. That gives stakers an APR of about 2.23% (computed). The rate was cut by 70/day in the [2026-05-20 ARFC](https://governance.aave.com/t/arfc-stkaave-emissions-update/24945), which targeted 2.75% APR.

- Service-provider payments in AAVE.

- The 75,000 AAVE grant to Aave Labs approved on 2026-04-12 under "Aave Will Win" ([The Block](https://www.theblock.co/news/ecosystems/2026-04-12-aave-dao-approves-25-million-aave-labs-funding-grant-in-binding-aave-will-win-vote-397138)).

- Overhang: Aave Labs holds an undisclosed AAVE allocation. The founding team kept 23% of LEND at the 2017 ICO ([ACI, 2026-02-25](https://governance.aave.com/t/aave-labs-86-million-23-of-the-token-supply-and-this-is-their-track-record/24159)). On 2026-06-26 Stani Kulechov confirmed that "Aave Labs owns an allocation of AAVE that multiple market participants have discussed purchasing" ([Unchained](https://unchainedcrypto.com/aaves-stani-kulechov-refutes-reported-kraken-stake-deal-teases-new-buyback-program/)). Its size and wallets are not public.

