| Hugo Danet | Former co-founder | Left Feb 2022 (secondary source). |

- Legal structure:

- Morpho Association is a French loi-1901 non-profit. It cannot have shareholders or distribute profits. It runs morpho.org and the docs and holds the IP of morpho-blue, metamorpho and vault-v2.

- It wholly owns Morpho Labs SAS (Paris, EU hiring, 100% share transfer announced 2025-06-06) and Morpho Labs Inc. (Delaware, US hiring).

- The Morpho DAO (MORPHO holders) controls the treasury and protocol parameters through Snapshot plus the governance multisig.

- Four Pillars notes that the Association and Labs share leadership. I found no public name for the Association's board.

- Other key actors:

- Leading curators: Steakhouse Financial, Gauntlet, Sentora, Galaxy, Bitwise, Armitage/Wintermute.

- Large delegates: Stake Capital (~8.8M), leuts.eth (Anthony Leutenegger, ~2.5M), Gauntlet (~1.6M), per Four Pillars, Mar 2026.

- Spearbit is the professional multisig signer under MIP-133; the Safe is 6-of-10 on-chain.

- Official accounts: [@Morpho](https://x.com/Morpho); forum [forum.morpho.org](https://forum.morpho.org).

