- Berachain $0.1M

Euler took over the HyperEVM (Mewler) deployment from HypurrFi in May 2026. Labs plans to deprecate low-activity chains from the official app.

- Geography of the token: Korean retail flows are important since the Upbit and Bithumb KRW listings in July 2026.

