#### Allocation and vesting (official)

The commonly cited DAO-approved split is about 52.1% Ecosystem Growth, 33.0% Protocol Development (core contributors), 12.9% Private Sales and about 2.0% Community Access Sale on CoinList. The split is confirmed by the DefiLlama unlock dataset ([defillama-datasets.llama.fi/emissions/ondo-finance](https://defillama-datasets.llama.fi/emissions/ondo-finance), fetched 2026-11-10): Ecosystem Growth 5,210.9M, Protocol Development 3,300.0M, Private Sales 1,290.2M, Community Access Sale 198.9M. The Foundation docs confirm the investor terms: CoinList Tranche 1 about 0.3% (1-year lock plus 18-month release) and Tranche 2 about 1.7% (1-year lock plus 6-month release). Seed investors hold under 7% ($4M equity round) and Series A investors under 7% ($20M equity round), each with a 1-year lock plus 48-month release. "Ondo core team members are bound by a 5-year lock-up."

#### Unlocks ahead

- Next tranche: 2027-01-17/18, 1,710.1M ONDO (17.1% of supply): Ecosystem Growth 792.1M + Protocol Development 660.0M + Private Sales 258.0M, per the DefiLlama unlock dataset (event timestamp 2027-01-17 17:25 UTC; [raw JSON](https://defillama-datasets.llama.fi/emissions/ondo-finance), [page](https://defillama.com/unlocks/ondo-finance)) and [Tokenomist](https://tokenomist.ai/ondo-finance/unlock-events) (2027-01-18; via search snippet, page not fetched). The same 1,710.1M tranche fell on 2025-01-17 and 2026-01-17. Correction: the earlier draft cited a "final ~0.79B tranche in January 2029 (MEXC)" and a "~1.94B" 2025 cliff; DefiLlama shows equal 1,710.1M annual tranches. DefiLlama's own data is internally inconsistent on the tail: its event list ends with a final 1,710.1M tranche on 2028-01-17, while its documented supply chart (which matches CG's 4,869M circulating) has tranches on 2027-01-18, 2028-01-18 and a last one on 2029-01-18. Either way, 2 or 3 more tranches of about 1.71B each remain.

- Important nuance (verified on-chain): no vesting contract enforces the schedule. All non-circulating ONDO sits in one Safe, Multisig 2, and "unlocking" means Ondo sending tokens out of it. The real supply release is therefore the multisig outflow. In 2025: 1,448.6M ONDO went to distributor Safe 0x5240…1fd0. In 2026 year to date: 825M ONDO (100M on 01-13 to 0x5240…; then 125M on 04-22 and 150M each on 05-11, 06-22, 08-21 and 09-23 to distributor Safe 0xea57…75e1). That Safe passed 689M on to 37 recipient addresses in chunks of about 23–26M (April–October 2026). Its remaining balance is 36.0M. The recipients are unlabelled on Etherscan, so whether they are sellers is not determinable. 825M is about 17% of current circulating supply.

