### How it works

#### The token

- Governance: the Ondo DAO is a fork of Compound Governor Bravo at 0x336505EC1BcC1A020EeDe459f57581725D23465A, with Timelock 0x2c5898da4DF1d45EAb2B7B192a361C3b9EB18d9c, run through [Tally](https://www.tally.xyz/gov/ondo-dao). On-chain parameters read on 2026-11-10: proposalThreshold 100,000,000 ONDO, quorumVotes 1,000,000 ONDO, votingPeriod 21,600 blocks (about 3 days), proposalCount 10 (re-read 2026-11-10 at block 26,385,591). All 9 ProposalCreated events fall between 2023-01-30 and 2024-01-12, the last being FIP-08 (token unlock). Most proposals were Flux Finance parameters: markets, oracles and interest-rate curves.

- What governance controls: by the docs, "economic parameters and smart contract upgrades" of "the protocol". In practice that has meant Flux Finance only. USDY, OUSG, Ondo Stocks, Ondo Perps and the Ondo Network are run by Ondo Finance Inc. subsidiaries under securities-law structures, and the DAO has no on-chain control over them.

- Mechanisms the token does not have: no fee switch, no buyback, no burn, no staking or lock-and-earn, no ve-locking, no gas role, and no required collateral role in any Ondo product (verified: DL holders revenue = 0; no burn sink; no governance proposal since January 2024). Note: per the Foundation docs, locked (treasury) tokens can still vote.

#### The products (how users use them)

- USDY (US Dollar Yield Token): a tokenized bearer note for non-US investors under Regulation S. It is secured by short-term US Treasuries, the iShares 0–1Y Treasury ETF held as SHVon, and bank deposits. The accumulating USDY price rises; rUSDY rebases at $1.00. Since 2025-12-15 the issuer is Ondo Global Markets (BVI) Limited ([docs](https://docs.ondo.finance/general-access-products/usdy/basics)). Users onboard with KYC, then mint or redeem with USDC 24/7 through the InstantManager, or buy peer-to-peer without KYC. Since 2026-11-01 the price on Ethereum, BNB, Mantle and Tempo comes from a ContinuousPriceOracle that compounds every second at a stored APY. A routine APY change is capped on-chain at 10% of the current rate, at most once per 8 hours. Larger changes require a timelock ([docs](https://docs.ondo.finance/general-access-products/usdy/usdy-price-oracle)).

- OUSG: a tokenized fund share for US Qualified Purchasers and similar investors, holding short-term Treasury funds from BlackRock, Franklin Templeton, WisdomTree, Fidelity and others, plus bank deposits and USDC. It offers instant 24/7 mint and redeem in USDC or PYUSD ($5k minimum) and a daily NAV oracle. The 0.15% management fee is waived until 2027-01-01 ([docs](https://docs.ondo.finance/qualified-access-products/ousg/overview)).

- Ondo Stocks (also branded Ondo Global Markets; the Ondo blog already used "Ondo Stocks" on 2026-02-03, while Ondo Perps docs still say "Ondo Global Markets"; exact rename date not verified): tokenized notes for non-US investors tracking 470+ US stocks and ETFs. Ondo buys the underlying through US broker-dealers and quotes the investor a price with a spread. "Any difference and any fees" are retained by Ondo Stocks ([docs](https://docs.ondo.finance/ondo-stocks/fees-and-taxes)). Dividends are reinvested net of 30% US withholding, because the BVI issuer pays that rate. The tokens are freely transferable and used in DeFi: Uniswap pools, lending markets, HyperEVM, Robinhood Chain and Solana via Jupiter. Approved institutions can convert shares in kind through Alpaca ITN (2026-09-21).

- Ondo Intelligent Portfolios (2026-09-24): single tokens wrapping model portfolios of Ondo Stocks, starting with three BlackRock-designed strategies: BLKHIon, BLKDIGon and BLKGRWon. Each charges an annual service fee accrued in the token price.

- Ondo Private Markets (2026-10-05): tokenized notes whose payout is linked to private-company share value at a liquidity event. The first was a pre-IPO AI company (ticker OPAIPon on Ondo Perps).

- Ondo Perps (announced 2026-02-03, live around 2026-07-20), made available by Ondo Global (Panama) Inc. ([docs](https://docs.ondoperps.xyz/about.md)): an off-chain-matched equity, index, commodity, crypto and FX perps venue for non-US users. It offers up to 20x leverage and accepts tokenized stocks (SPYon, QQQon, NVDAon and others) as haircut collateral. It is in Public Beta with a $1M maximum position per market per account ([docs](https://docs.ondoperps.xyz/public-beta.md)).

- Ondo Network (announced 2026-07-27): replaces the previously announced "Ondo Chain" L1. It is an execution layer where application logic runs in TEEs (secure enclaves) under a multi-party attestor quorum that verifies code and holds key shares. Asset transfers settle on public chains. Its first application is Ondo Perps. Future "bonded participation" and "proof-of-stake security model" roles are mentioned only as "possible directions". The post does not name ONDO as the stake asset ([blog](https://ondo.finance/blog/introducing-the-ondo-network)).

- Flux Finance: a Compound-v2 fork that lends stablecoins against OUSG. DL TVL is $43.5M plus $34.8M borrowed (2026-11-10), with collateral of $39.4M in OUSG. It is the only product the DAO governs on-chain.

### Utility

- Real utility today: voting in the Ondo DAO, which in practice means Flux Finance parameters and a dormant governor. ONDO is also a liquid speculative asset, listed on major centralized exchanges with large balances on Bithumb, Binance, Bybit and Bitpanda, and tradable as a perp on Ondo Perps (ONDO-USD.P OI $138k, 24h volume $78k, API 2026-11-10 16:10 UTC).

- Not needed for: minting, holding or redeeming USDY, OUSG, Ondo Stocks, Intelligent Portfolios or Private Markets; trading on Ondo Perps, where fees are in USDC, collateral is USDC or tokenized stocks, and there is no ONDO fee discount in the published schedule ([fees](https://docs.ondoperps.xyz/fees.md)); or running the Ondo Network, whose attestors are permissioned operators today.

- Potential future utility (not committed): the Ondo Network post mentions possible future bonded attestors, watchers and stake-weighted liquidation lotteries. The earlier Ondo Chain design had validators staking assets. Neither has been specified as ONDO staking in an official document seen for this report.

- Conclusion: governance-only. The token holds an option on future value accrual that Ondo Finance Inc. and the Foundation have not exercised.

### Why people buy and sell it

#### Demand drivers

- Narrative proxy: ONDO is the most liquid listed token tied to the market leader in tokenized treasuries and stocks. Wall Street-adjacent news drives it, including BlackRock strategies, DTCC, Fidelity FCAT, Broadridge, the J.P. Morgan Kinexys/Mastercard/Ripple redemption, and a planned Anthropic IPO-day token.

- Option value on a fee switch: Allium in May 2026 rated ONDO "Market Perform" and called an "H2 2026 fee-switch DAO vote" "the binary catalyst". No such official vote exists, as shown in the Revenue section. Speculation on it nonetheless supports the price.

- Valuation framing: market cap of $1.78B (CG, 2026-11-10 16:04 UTC) against Ondo platform AUM of about $4.14B (USDY $2.39B + OUSG $0.32B + Stocks $1.43B) gives about 0.43x. FDV/AUM is about 0.88x (Estimate).

- Korean retail: Bithumb's cold wallet (208M) holds more ONDO than Binance's (180M). The Kakaopay Securities MOU (2026-09-28) is a Korea-facing catalyst.

#### Supply and sell pressure

- Treasury distributions: 825M ONDO out of Multisig 2 in 2026 year to date, and 1.45B in 2025.

- The January 2027 tranche of 1,710.1M (DefiLlama), followed by one or two more equal tranches (2028, possibly 2029). The 2025-01-17 tranche (also 1,710.1M per DefiLlama) preceded a large drawdown in the first half of 2025, according to secondary commentary.

- Investor and team tranches from the $24M equity rounds (Founders Fund, Pantera, Coinbase Ventures, Tiger Global per CoinDesk via Blockonomi) and the 5-year team lock-up; DefiLlama's documented schedule ends Protocol Development releases on 2029-01-18, five years after transferability.

- Structural: holders get no cash flow, while product revenue flows to Ondo equity. The forum thread "Ondo Finance Leadership" (2026-03-08) documents retail frustration with "no clear economic linkage".

- Uncertainty about the control dispute and the estate's large ONDO position (amount unknown).

### The protocol/business

Ondo Finance Inc. (Delaware, New York-based, founded 2021 by ex-Goldman Sachs staff) builds "institutional-grade platforms, assets, and infrastructure to bring financial markets onchain". It has raised $24M in equity plus a $10M CoinList token sale ($34M total). No valuation has been disclosed ([CoinDesk via Blockonomi](https://blockonomi.com/ondo-finance-rejects-sale-talk-report-as-court-fight-over-control-continues)). It acquired Oasis Pro (2025-10-07), which brought an SEC-registered broker-dealer, ATS and transfer-agent licences ([blog](https://ondo.finance/blog/ondo-acquires-oasis-pro)). In February 2026 it confidentially filed an SEC registration statement for the Ondo Stocks issuer. It tokenized IVV and MU inside the US regulatory perimeter on 2026-07-02, and requested SEC no-action relief on 2026-04-13.

