curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/fees/ondo-finance?dataType=dailyFees"            # pass-through yieldcurl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/fees/ondo-finance?dataType=dailyHoldersRevenue"  # 0curl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/ondo-global-markets"                        # Ondo Stocks mint/redeem volumecurl -s "https://api.llama.fi/summary/open-interest/ondo-perps"                        # Perps OIcurl -s "https://api.ondoperps.xyz/v1/perps/contracts"   # per-market usdVolume, openInterestUsd, makerFee, takerFee

Ondo Stocks token contracts are listed in Ondo's CSV linked from [docs.ondo.finance/addresses](https://docs.ondo.finance/addresses). On Ethereum, mints and redeems go through GMTokenManager 0x2c158BC456e027b2AfFCCadF1BDBD9f5fC4c5C8c, which emits TradeExecuted events that DL counts. The quote spread Ondo keeps cannot be observed on-chain: execution prices of the underlying shares are off-chain.

### Key people

| Person | Role | Notes |

| --- | --- | --- |

| Nathan Allman | Founder; was CEO, sole director and controlling shareholder | Died 2026-05-25, aged 32, without a will. His estate is represented by his mother, Kathleen Allman (appointed 2026-06-26 in Hawaii probate). Ondo's tribute is on its [blog](https://ondo.finance/blog/onward-remembering-nathan-allman-and-the-road-ahead) (2026-06-01). |

| Ian De Bode | "Acting CEO and President" (team page); signed the 2026-06-01 post as CEO | Previously President. The estate's reconstituted four-seat board (Kathleen Allman and Nathan's sister Tahnee Towill among the directors) voted on 2026-07-24 to remove him and named Kathleen Allman board chair, CEO, secretary and treasurer on an interim basis (Parameter, 2026-08-07). De Bode disputes this and calls the claims "meritless". A court order lets him run daily operations but not make major changes. The estate challenges a pay package of about $11M. |

| Patrick McHenry | Vice Chairman | Former Chair of the US House Financial Services Committee |

| Mark Janoff | General Counsel |  |

