| Justin Schmidt | Advisor |  |

Structure: Ondo Finance Inc. (Delaware) provides technology. Ondo Global Markets (BVI) Ltd issues USDY and Ondo Stocks; Ondo Finance Inc. is an equity holder. Ondo Global (Panama) Inc. makes Ondo Perps available (Perps docs). The Oasis Pro entities hold the US broker-dealer, ATS and transfer-agent licences. Ondo Foundation (Cayman, no beneficial owners) issues ONDO and holds the treasury. The Ondo DAO governs Flux. Official X accounts: @OndoFinance (DL metadata), @OndoFoundation (CG metadata), @OndoPerps (Perps site metadata). Individual executives' handles were not verified in this research. Source for the team list: [ondo.finance/team](https://ondo.finance/team), fetched 2026-11-10.

### Recent news (last ~90 days)

- 2026-11-10 Fidelity's FCAT becomes a required DVN verifier for Ondo Stocks bridge transfers. Ondo says tokenized stocks "top $3 billion" ([blog](https://ondo.finance/blog/ondo-bridge-adds-fcat-as-required-verifier)).

