### Verification notes

Independent fact-check performed 2026-11-10, about 15:55–16:15 UTC, by a second researcher. Web search quota was exhausted during this pass, so checks relied on direct fetches of primary pages, APIs and on-chain reads.

#### Independently re-checked and confirmed

- On-chain (Ethereum block 26,385,591): ONDO totalSupply 10,000,000,000; Multisig 2 balance 5,179,207,574.16; 0x…dEaD 7.59 ONDO; distributor 0xea57… 36.0M; Governor proposalCount 10, threshold 100M, quorum 1M, votingPeriod 21,600, timelock 0x2c58…8d9c; 9 ProposalCreated logs 2023-01-30 to 2024-01-12; mint of 10B to Multisig 2 on 2022-04-28.

- Etherscan tokentx: 2026 outflows of 825M and 2025 outflows of 1,448.6M from Multisig 2, with the exact dates listed; distributor 0xea57… sent 689.0M to 37 addresses.

- USDY oracle price 1.152686 and APY 3.7501784614%; USDY supply on Ethereum, BNB, Sei, Arbitrum, Mantle, Solana and Stellar; OUSG supply on Ethereum (1,121,340.57) and XRPL (1,584,220.17); CG OUSG market cap $317.12M.

- DefiLlama: fees 7d/30d/1y/all-time; revenue and holders revenue 0 in every period; methodology text; Ondo Stocks volume; Perps OI; Flux TVL and fees.

- Ondo site and docs: USDY report figures (2026-11-06), Stocks TVL $1.43B / 470+ / ~270,100 holders, OUSG fee waiver to 2027-01-01, Stocks spread retention, Foundation token terms, DAO parameters, oracle switch on 2026-11-01 with 10%/8-hour limits, team page roles; all 17 Ondo blog URLs open and dates match; Perps fees, $1M beta cap and August 2026 collateral changelog; Flux forum threads 1138/1040/1032 (authors, dates, no staff replies; the "no clear economic linkage" quote).

- Lawsuit facts (death 2026-05-25, age 32, intestate; filing 2026-07-24; Chancellor McCormick; 07-24 board vote; ~$11M pay package; 09-25 denial of sale report) against Blockonomi and Parameter. CoinDesk itself stayed blocked.

- Allium report (dated 2026-05-17; snapshot 2026-05-12; 97.3% top-1% concentration; "H2 2026 fee-switch vote" wording) and LiveBitcoinNews (2026-05-02).

#### Corrected

- Unlock schedule: replaced "~0.79B final tranche January 2029 (MEXC)" and "~1.94B 2025 cliff" with DefiLlama's raw dataset (1,710.1M each on 2025-01-17, 2026-01-17, 2027-01-17, plus 2028 and possibly 2029). Added the confirmed allocation split.

- Token name() is "Ondo", not "Ondo Finance".

- Governance dormancy is about 34 months, not 22. The last proposal was created, not executed, on 2024-01-12.

- Top-holders table: two unlabelled holders of 95.7M and 77.4M were missing, and Bitpanda 4 is not #7. The 0x460a… balance is 721.5M.

- Claim that only the 721M wallet and exchanges reach the 100M proposal threshold: the 100.2M Safe also does.

- Refreshed market data (CG price, market cap, FDV, rank, % changes, volume), holders count, DL 24h fees, Perps OI and volume and fee split (11 markets at 0.015%/0.035%), CG category figures, Spiko EUTBL in the treasury table.

- Perps operator is "Ondo Global (Panama) Inc." Perps was announced on 2026-02-03. The rename date of Ondo Global Markets to Ondo Stocks is unverified, and the "mid-2026" claim was removed.

- Removed the speculative ~$17.7M/yr "issuer capital" estimate on the USDY over-collateral, because Ondo's footnote ties it to structured financing. Noted that the 156.90% ratio cannot be reproduced from Ondo's two headline numbers.

- Removed the unverified Delaware case number. Added the interim board and CEO claims by the estate and the CFO background.

#### Remains unverified

- Tokenized Anthropic IPO-day plan (2026-11-06) and JTX listing (2026-11-05). These are secondary and could not be re-checked.

- Tokenomist date (page behind Cloudflare). USDY supply on Sui, Aptos, Noble, Tempo and Plume. Identity of large unlabelled ONDO and USDY holders. Whether distributor recipients sold. The size of the estate's ONDO position.

- Ondo's company revenue, the USDY spread take and Perps fee income. None of these is disclosed. The figures in section 7 are labelled estimates.
